# Secrets for vauly as one Worker. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for these; for
# `wrangler dev`, copy this file to .dev.vars.

# A code only you know. Until someone creates the workspace, it can only be created from
# https://<your vauly>/setup?code=<this code>. Leave it empty and whoever opens your vauly
# first becomes its owner.
SETUP_CODE=
